---
import Brand from "../components/Brand.astro";
import "../styles/fonts.css";

---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#071321" />
    <meta name="description" content="A visual direction experiment for ParqDB." />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <title>ParqDB — Parquet Blocks</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <header class="topbar">
      <div class="topbar-inner">
        <Brand variant="dark" />
        <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
          <a href="/docs">Docs</a><a href="https://search.parqdb.io/">Live demo</a><a href="https://github.com/parqdb-io/parqdb/tree/main/benchmarks/results">Benchmarks</a>
        </nav>
        <a class="github" href="https://github.com/parqdb-io/parqdb">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 .7a11.5 11.5 0 0 0-3.64 22.4c.58.1.79-.25.79-.56v-2.23c-3.22.7-3.9-1.37-3.9-1.37-.52-1.34-1.28-1.7-1.28-1.7-1.05-.72.08-.7.08-.7 1.16.08 1.77 1.19 1.77 1.19 1.03 1.77 2.7 1.26 3.36.96.1-.75.4-1.26.73-1.55-2.57-.29-5.27-1.28-5.27-5.69 0-1.26.45-2.28 1.19-3.09-.12-.29-.52-1.46.11-3.05 0 0 .97-.31 3.16 1.18A10.9 10.9 0 0 1 12 6.1c.98 0 1.95.13 2.87.39 2.2-1.49 3.16-1.18 3.16-1.18.63 1.59.23 2.76.11 3.05.74.81 1.19 1.83 1.19 3.09 0 4.42-2.71 5.39-5.29 5.68.42.36.79 1.06.79 2.14v3.18c0 .31.21.67.8.56A11.5 11.5 0 0 0 12 .7Z" /></svg>
          <span>Star on GitHub</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b>
        </a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main id="main">
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-shell">
          <article class="hero-copy">
            <div class="eyebrow">Open vector search infrastructure</div>
            <h1>Billion-scale<br />vector search,<br /><em>built on Parquet.</em></h1>
            <p>One open index for embedded apps, query servers, and the browser. Search data larger than memory without moving it into another proprietary system.</p>
            <div class="actions">
              <a class="primary-action" href="/docs/getting-started"><span>Get started</span><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a>
              <a class="text-action" href="https://github.com/parqdb-io/parqdb">View source <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            </div>
            <div class="install"><span>$</span><code>pip install parqdb</code><b>PYTHON · ARROW</b></div>
          </article>

          <aside class="index-art" data-active="embedded" aria-label="Three Parquet files in object storage queried by embedded, server, and browser runtimes">
            <header class="art-head">
              <div><span>ONE IMMUTABLE INDEX</span><strong>OBJECT STORAGE</strong></div>
              <span class="live"><i></i> OPEN</span>
            </header>
            <div class="runtime-row" role="tablist" aria-label="Query runtime">
              <button class="active" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-runtime="embedded"><span>01</span><strong>Embedded</strong></button>
              <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-runtime="server"><span>02</span><strong>Server</strong></button>
              <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-runtime="browser"><span>03</span><strong>Browser</strong></button>
            </div>
            <div class="ascii-stage">
              <div class="runtime-scenes">
                <pre class="runtime-scene scene-embedded" aria-label="ParqDB embedded with its page cache">╔═ APP PROCESS ══════╗
║                    ║░
║  PARQDB  │  CACHE  ║░
║                    ║░
╚════════════════════╝░
 <span>░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░</span></pre>
                <pre class="runtime-scene scene-server" aria-label="A client querying a ParqDB server">   ╔═ CLIENT ═════╗
   ║              ║░
   ╚══════════════╝░
          │ HTTP
          ▼
╔═ PARQDB SERVER ═══╗
║  ENGINE  │ CACHE  ║░
╚═══════════════════╝░
 <span>░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░</span></pre>
                <pre class="runtime-scene scene-browser" aria-label="ParqDB WebAssembly running with a browser page cache">╔═ BROWSER TAB ══════╗
║                    ║░
║ PARQDB WASM│ CACHE ║░
║                    ║░
╚════════════════════╝░
 <span>░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░</span></pre>
              </div>
              <pre class="range-link" aria-hidden="true">── RANGE ─▶
◀─ PAGES ──</pre>
              <pre class="storage-scene" aria-label="Object storage containing three Parquet files, with four pages selected from each file">╔═ OBJECT STORAGE ═══════════╗
║                            ║░
║ centroids.parquet  ░░░░<b>████</b> ║░
║ postings-0042      ░░<b>████</b>░░ ║░
║ source.parquet     <b>████</b>░░░░ ║░
║                            ║░
╚════════════════════════════╝░
 <span>░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░</span></pre>
            </div>
            <footer class="art-foot"><span>HTTP RANGE</span><b>READ 12 PAGES · SKIP THE REST</b><span>PARQUET</span></footer>
          </aside>
        </div>

        <div class="proof-line" aria-label="SIFT1B benchmark results">
          <div><span>DATASET</span><strong>SIFT1B</strong></div><div><span>INDEX</span><strong>IVF–LVQ8</strong></div><div><span>LATENCY</span><strong>63.05 ms</strong></div><div><span>RECALL@10</span><strong>90.3%</strong></div><div><span>QUERY LIMIT</span><strong>2 cores · 4 GB</strong></div><a href="https://github.com/parqdb-io/parqdb/tree/main/benchmarks/results/linux-x86_64-2026-08-17"><span>RAW RESULTS</span><strong>Inspect ↗</strong></a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="thesis">
        <header class="thesis-copy">
          <span>WHY PARQDB / 03</span><h2>The index is data.<br />The engine stays open.</h2><p>ParqDB keeps vector search inside the data ecosystem you already use. Inspect it, publish it, cache it, and query it where the work happens.</p>
        </header>
        <div class="sequence">
          <article><span class="sequence-index">01</span><div class="sequence-visual files-visual" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div><h3>Everything is Parquet.</h3><p>Source tables and vector indexes stay in a standard, inspectable columnar format.</p></div></article>
          <article><span class="sequence-index">02</span><div class="sequence-visual prune-visual" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div><h3>Read only what survives.</h3><p>Route, prune, and fetch selected pages instead of loading the entire index.</p></div></article>
          <article><span class="sequence-index">03</span><div class="sequence-visual runtime-visual" aria-hidden="true"><i>PY</i><i>API</i><i>WASM</i></div><div><h3>Query where the work happens.</h3><p>The same immutable index serves embedded, client-server, and browser workloads.</p></div></article>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <footer class="site-footer"><Brand variant="dark" /><span>Visual direction experiment · /vision</span><a href="https://github.com/parqdb-io/parqdb">GitHub ↗</a></footer>

    <script>
      const art = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>(".index-art");
      const runtimes = [...document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-runtime]")];
      runtimes.forEach((button) => button.addEventListener("click", () => {
        runtimes.forEach((item) => { const active = item === button; item.classList.toggle("active", active); item.setAttribute("aria-selected", String(active)); });
        art?.setAttribute("data-active", button.dataset.runtime ?? "embedded");
        art?.classList.remove("route-pulse"); if (art) void art.offsetWidth; art?.classList.add("route-pulse");
      }));
    </script>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
  :global(html) { background: #071321; scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  :global(body) { margin: 0; min-width: 320px; color: #091627; background: #f3f4f0; font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  :global(a) { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  :global(button) { font: inherit; }
  :global(::selection) { color: #fff; background: #0066cc; }
  :global(:focus-visible) { outline: 3px solid #76beff; outline-offset: 4px; }
  .skip-link { position: fixed; top: -80px; left: 20px; z-index: 100; padding: 12px 16px; color: #fff; background: #0066cc; }.skip-link:focus { top: 12px; }

  .topbar { color: #edf5ff; background: #071321; }
  .topbar-inner { display: grid; width: min(1280px, calc(100% - 48px)); height: 74px; align-items: center; margin-inline: auto; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr; }
  .topbar :global(.brand) { justify-self: start; }
  nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 34px; }
  nav a { position: relative; padding-block: 26px; color: #a9b8ca; font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }
  nav a::after { content: ""; position: absolute; bottom: 18px; left: 0; width: 34px; height: 4px; background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, #32a8ff 0 6px, transparent 6px 9px); transform: scaleX(0); transform-origin: left; transition: transform 180ms ease; }
  nav a:hover { color: #fff; }nav a:hover::after { transform: scaleX(1); }
  .github { display: inline-flex; min-height: 42px; align-items: center; justify-self: end; gap: 9px; padding-right: 13px; border: 1px solid #3d4d62; font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; }
  .github svg { width: 40px; height: 40px; padding: 10px; border-right: 1px solid #3d4d62; }.github:hover { border-color: #76beff; background: #10243b; }

  .hero { padding-top: 30px; color: #eef5fc; background: #071321; }
  .hero-shell { display: grid; width: min(1280px, calc(100% - 48px)); min-height: 690px; align-items: stretch; margin-inline: auto; grid-template-columns: .94fr 1.06fr; }
  .hero-copy { display: flex; min-width: 0; padding: 54px 64px 52px 0; flex-direction: column; }
  .eyebrow { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; color: #89a0b9; font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  h1 { margin: 52px 0 0; color: #f6f8fb; font-size: clamp(57px, 5.25vw, 79px); font-weight: 780; line-height: .91; letter-spacing: -.07em; }h1 em { color: #32a8ff; font-style: normal; }
  .hero-copy > p { max-width: 610px; margin: 30px 0 0; color: #9dafc2; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.58; }
  .actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 26px; margin-top: 34px; }
  .primary-action { display: grid; min-height: 48px; color: #fff; background: #0066cc; grid-template-columns: 150px 48px; font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; }
  .primary-action span, .primary-action b { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border: 1px solid #57aaff; }.primary-action b { border-left: 0; font-size: 18px; transition: transform 180ms ease; }.primary-action:hover b { transform: translate(3px, -3px); }
  .text-action { color: #dce8f4; font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; }.text-action span { display: inline-block; margin-left: 5px; transition: transform 180ms ease; }.text-action:hover span { transform: translate(3px, -3px); }
  .install { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-top: auto; padding-top: 32px; border-top: 1px solid #273b52; color: #dbe8f5; }.install > span { color: #32a8ff; }.install code { font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace; font-size: 13px; }.install b { margin-left: auto; color: #7f93aa; font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace; font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: .1em; }

  .index-art { --active-x: 16.667%; position: relative; display: flex; min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; padding: 30px 28px 24px; border-left: 1px solid #293d54; background: radial-gradient(circle at 70% 52%, rgba(34,112,188,.13), transparent 39%); flex-direction: column; }
  .index-art[data-active="server"] { --active-x: 50%; }.index-art[data-active="browser"] { --active-x: 83.333%; }
  .art-head { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; }.art-head > div { display: grid; gap: 8px; }
  .art-head span, .art-head strong, .live { font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .1em; }.art-head span { color: #788ca3; }.art-head strong { color: #aebed0; }
  .live { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; color: #8fcaff; }.live i { width: 7px; height: 7px; background: #32a8ff; box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(50,168,255,.12); }
  .runtime-row { position: relative; display: grid; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid #31475f; border-bottom: 1px solid #31475f; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
  .runtime-row::after { content: ""; position: absolute; z-index: 3; right: 0; bottom: 0; left: 0; height: 3px; background: #d9efff; opacity: 0; transform: scaleX(0); transform-origin: left; }
  .route-pulse .runtime-row::after { animation: line-clear 520ms cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1) both; }
  .runtime-row button { display: grid; padding: 12px 10px; border: 0; border-right: 1px solid #31475f; color: #8195ac; background: transparent; text-align: left; cursor: pointer; }.runtime-row button:last-child { border-right: 0; }
  .runtime-row span { font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace; font-size: 8px; }.runtime-row strong { margin-top: 7px; font-size: 11px; }.runtime-row button:hover { color: #dcecff; background: #0e2238; }.runtime-row button.active { color: #fff; background: #0066cc; }

  .ascii-stage { display: grid; min-height: 420px; align-items: center; margin-top: 12px; padding-block: 28px 18px; grid-template-columns: minmax(170px, .9fr) 82px minmax(245px, 1.1fr); gap: 13px; flex: 1; }
  .runtime-scenes { display: grid; min-height: 235px; place-items: center; }
  .runtime-scene, .range-link, .storage-scene { overflow: visible; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0; color: #eaf3fb; background: transparent; font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace; font-size: clamp(11px, 1.06vw, 15px); font-variant-ligatures: none; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.04; letter-spacing: 0; white-space: pre; }
  .runtime-scene { visibility: hidden; grid-area: 1 / 1; opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); transition: opacity 180ms ease, transform 180ms ease, visibility 0s linear 180ms; }
  .runtime-scene span, .storage-scene span { position: relative; top: 3px; color: #46576b; }
  .index-art[data-active="embedded"] .scene-embedded, .index-art[data-active="server"] .scene-server, .index-art[data-active="browser"] .scene-browser { visibility: visible; opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); transition-delay: 0s; }
  .scene-server { font-size: clamp(9px, .88vw, 12px); line-height: 1; }
  .range-link { color: #8297ae; font-size: 9px; line-height: 1.5; text-align: center; }
  .storage-scene { justify-self: end; }
  .storage-scene b { color: #55b7ff; font-weight: 400; text-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(50,168,255,.6); }
  .route-pulse .storage-scene b { animation: page-lock 520ms cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1) both; }
  .art-foot { display: flex; min-height: 34px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; border-top: 1px solid #31475f; color: #8296ad; font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace; font-size: 8px; }.art-foot b { color: #a9bed3; font-weight: 400; }.art-foot span:last-child { color: #32a8ff; }

  .proof-line { position: relative; display: grid; width: min(1280px, calc(100% - 48px)); min-height: 90px; margin-inline: auto; border-top: 1px solid #31475f; border-inline: 1px solid #31475f; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr); }
  .proof-line > * { display: flex; min-width: 0; justify-content: center; padding: 19px 20px; border-right: 1px solid #31475f; color: #eff6ff; flex-direction: column; }.proof-line > *:last-child { border-right: 0; }
  .proof-line span { color: #8296ac; font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace; font-size: 8px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; }.proof-line strong { margin-top: 8px; font-size: 16px; }.proof-line a { color: #b9dcff; background: #0e2136; }

  .thesis { display: grid; width: min(1280px, calc(100% - 48px)); margin: 120px auto 132px; grid-template-columns: .84fr 1.16fr; }.thesis-copy { padding: 18px 70px 0 0; }
  .thesis-copy > span, .sequence-index { color: #0066cc; font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .1em; }.thesis-copy h2 { margin: 28px 0 0; font-size: clamp(49px, 5vw, 72px); line-height: .92; letter-spacing: -.065em; }.thesis-copy p { max-width: 540px; margin: 28px 0 0; color: #596777; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .sequence { border-top: 1px solid #aeb8c3; }.sequence article { display: grid; min-height: 190px; align-items: center; padding: 28px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #aeb8c3; grid-template-columns: 48px 210px 1fr; gap: 24px; }.sequence article > div:last-child { padding-right: 18px; }
  .sequence h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 25px; line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -.04em; }.sequence p { max-width: 390px; margin: 12px 0 0; color: #5d6977; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; }
  .sequence-visual { display: grid; gap: 4px; }.files-visual, .prune-visual { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }.sequence-visual i { display: flex; height: 31px; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: #dce3ea; font-style: normal; }
  .files-visual i:nth-child(4), .files-visual i:nth-child(5) { background: #0066cc; }.prune-visual i { transition: opacity 180ms ease, transform 180ms ease; }.prune-visual i:not(:nth-child(3)):not(:nth-child(7)) { opacity: .18; transform: scale(.72); }.prune-visual i:nth-child(3), .prune-visual i:nth-child(7) { background: #32a8ff; }
  .runtime-visual { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }.runtime-visual i { color: #fff; background: #0c2035; font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace; font-size: 8px; }.runtime-visual i:last-child { color: #0a1728; background: #b9e3ff; }
  .site-footer { display: grid; min-height: 110px; align-items: center; padding: 0 max(24px, calc((100vw - 1280px) / 2)); color: #8292a5; background: #071321; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr; font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace; font-size: 9px; }.site-footer > a:last-child { justify-self: end; color: #dceaff; }

  @keyframes page-lock { 0% { opacity: 0; filter: blur(2px); } 55% { opacity: 1; color: #fff; } 100% { opacity: 1; filter: blur(0); } }
  @keyframes line-clear { 0% { opacity: 0; transform: scaleX(0); } 45% { opacity: 1; transform: scaleX(1); } 100% { opacity: 0; transform: scaleX(1); } }

  @media (max-width: 1040px) { .hero-shell { grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr; }.hero-copy { padding-right: 36px; }h1 { font-size: clamp(51px, 6.1vw, 68px); }.sequence article { grid-template-columns: 40px 170px 1fr; gap: 16px; } }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .topbar-inner { width: calc(100% - 28px); height: 66px; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; }.topbar :global(.brand), .topbar :global(.brand img) { width: 112px; }nav { display: none; }.github { min-height: 38px; padding-right: 10px; font-size: 9px; }.github svg { width: 36px; height: 36px; }
    .hero { padding-top: 8px; }.hero-shell { display: block; width: calc(100% - 28px); }.hero-copy { min-height: 660px; padding: 48px 0 34px; }h1 { margin-top: 46px; font-size: clamp(47px, 13vw, 60px); }.hero-copy > p { font-size: 15px; }.actions { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }.primary-action { width: 100%; grid-template-columns: 1fr 48px; }.install { margin-top: auto; }.install b { display: none; }
    .index-art { min-height: 620px; padding: 28px 14px 18px; border-top: 1px solid #293d54; border-left: 0; }.ascii-stage { min-height: 450px; padding-block: 34px 20px; grid-template-columns: 1fr; grid-template-rows: 145px 50px 1fr; gap: 12px; }.runtime-scenes { min-height: 145px; }.runtime-scene { font-size: clamp(10px, 3.45vw, 14px); }.scene-server { font-size: clamp(8px, 2.8vw, 11px); }.range-link { transform: rotate(90deg); }.storage-scene { justify-self: center; font-size: clamp(9px, 2.8vw, 12px); }.art-foot b { display: none; }
    .proof-line { width: calc(100% - 28px); grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }.proof-line > * { min-height: 82px; border-bottom: 1px solid #31475f; }.proof-line > *:nth-child(2n) { border-right: 0; }.proof-line > *:nth-last-child(-n+2) { border-bottom: 0; }
    .thesis { display: block; width: calc(100% - 28px); margin-block: 88px; }.thesis-copy { padding: 0 0 54px; }.thesis-copy h2 { font-size: 48px; }.sequence article { min-height: 0; padding: 28px 0 34px; grid-template-columns: 32px 1fr; gap: 22px 14px; }.sequence-visual { grid-column: 2; width: min(230px, 100%); }.sequence article > div:last-child { grid-column: 2; padding-right: 0; }.site-footer { min-height: 140px; padding: 24px 18px; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; }.site-footer > span { display: none; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { *, *::before, *::after { animation-duration: .01ms !important; animation-iteration-count: 1 !important; transition-duration: .01ms !important; } }
</style>
